              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejaun emedera loka iidukurun luka Reuben ari naka eŋalakimak kwape ejaatar irionetakec: ekapolon loka idwe luka Reuben ŋes Elisur okoku loka Sedeur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
