        },
        {
          "text": " Kere luaponi kimarai luka iidukurun luka Reuben emwaasi ilukumin akwatat ka akaisakany ka lodiopet, ka akwat aoŋon ka akaisakany, kwape ejaatar irionetakec, Kes iareikinete kalosit.",
